    "updated_at": "2019-08-19T13:32:03Z",
    "body": "We actually don’t double-key HSTS. Instead, we 1) restrict setting HSTS to only the first party registrable domain and the first party exact domain, and 2) we don’t apply HSTS to third party requests to domains we are blocking cookies for.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
